<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Compra Efetuada | Rural Sports</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.2.0/fonts/remixicon.css" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #0f0c25;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .success-card {
      background-color: #14122b;
      padding: 60px 40px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 191, 0.15);
      max-width: 500px;
      animation: popIn 0.5s ease;
    }

    @keyframes popIn {
      0% { transform: scale(0.8); opacity: 0; }
      100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
    }

    .icon-container {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .icon-container i {
      font-size: 80px;
      color: aquamarine;
    }

    h1 {
      color: aquamarine;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    p {
      color: #b6b6b6;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .btn-home {
      background-color: aquamarine;
      color: #141414;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 15px 40px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 16px;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .btn-home:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05);
      background-color: rgb(0, 230, 170);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="success-card">
    <div class="icon-container">
      <i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill"></i>
    </div>
    <h1>Compra Efetuada!</h1>
    <p>Obrigado por comprar na <strong>Rural Sports</strong>.<br>Seu pedido foi processado e seu estoque já foi atualizado.</p>
    
    <a href="/" class="btn-home">Voltar para a Loja</a>
  </div>

</body>
</html>